{"id": "告五人 醜人多作怪", "source_audio": {"audio_sha1": "251671908d", "audio_seconds": 257.544, "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQD5CBLl7yY"}, "why": "Studio MV, band vocal over full instrumentation. Sheet from NetEase.", "language": "zh", "sheet": [{"time": 10.64, "text": "珍惜突然成了一件沒有大不了的事", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 15.4, "text": "時光流逝只怕滿腹情懷 會太像個孩子", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 21.31, "text": "常常處於被告知是為了大好前程而賞賜", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 26.09, "text": "世道險惡的用心之至 該怎麼判斷怎麼知", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 31.91, "text": "醜人多作怪 我只能一刀往心裡竄", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 36.62, "text": "發現了你我都還遷就於情感 而不敢去想未來", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 42.4, "text": "醜人多作怪 你最好全部從實招來", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 47.53, "text": "發現了帳對不起來 誠實也沒了依賴", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 50.25, "text": "不承認又還想耍賴", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 76.0, "text": "在成就自我的途中", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 78.03, "text": "難免會碰到令人作嘔的時候", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 80.83, "text": "例如說誰太努力 誰太著急", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 83.55, "text": "誰太照順序 誰鼓勵誰的問題", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 86.82, "text": "可能 變的不好掌握", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 89.06, "text": "或者 其實是你另有圖謀", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 91.3, "text": "那就揭穿面具 揭穿道義", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 94.49, "text": "讓你繼續相信 是正義是無心", "end": 0.0, "co